{"id":"msm","title":"Move, split and merge","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"MSM transforms one ordered sequence through move, split and merge operations. Moving costs the absolute change in value. Split/merge costs depend on a base cost and neighboring values, so the recurrence uses local context instead of a fixed gap symbol. The animation displays its cumulative operation costs.","intro_zh":"MSM 通过移动、分裂和合并操作变换有序序列。移动费用是数值的绝对变化；分裂与合并费用取决于基础费用和邻近数值，因此递推使用局部上下文而非固定间隙符号。动图展示这些操作的累计费用。","steps_en":["Set the stated local scoring rule, tolerance and boundary conditions.","Compare a move with context-dependent split and merge costs.","Trace the selected predecessor operations from the complete-prefix state.","Read the final score with the normalization explicitly stated below."],"steps_zh":["设置明确的局部计分规则、容差与边界条件。","比较移动费用与依赖上下文的分裂、合并费用。","从完整前缀状态沿选定的前驱操作回溯。","按下方明确的归一化约定读取最终分数。"],"formula":"C(v,a,b)=c if v lies between a,b; else c+min(|v-a|,|v-b|); D=min(move,split,merge)","caveats_en":["This is a univariate definition with c=0.6. Multivariate dependent and independent generalizations require separate conventions.","The small arrays are an algorithm illustration, not evidence of retrieval or classification quality."],"caveats_zh":["本例是 c=0.6 的单变量定义；多变量的联合式与独立式推广须另行指定。","这些小数组用于解释计算过程，不构成检索或分类性能证据。"],"sources":[{"label":"aeon: Move-Split-Merge recurrence","url":"https://www.aeon-toolkit.org/en/stable/api_reference/auto_generated/aeon.distances.msm_distance.html"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"normalization":"none","local_norm":"absolute difference","c":0.6},"result":{"label":"distance","value":2.6,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare move with context-dependent split and merge transitions","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Candidate